				<wikidot:authorName>Dexanote</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>481882</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Originally he was a roleplay character from one of the IRC RPs. I've basically deconstructed him here and used the core character (With roleplay history, lolrandom quirks, and other details stripped away) to help move the story along.</p> <p>At one point I'd like to make the character into an actual SCP, but people keep doing new SCPs that take the direction I want to take with it.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
